---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Operating Divisions" description="Directory of Mathim Divisions operating groups: research, technical systems, and publications.">
  <section class="interior-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="interior-ref label"><span>Operations register / 02</span><span>MD–DIV / 2026</span></div>
      <h1>Several disciplines.<br/><em>One organization.</em></h1>
      <p>Independent work grouped by purpose, not constrained by a single industry.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-section" id="research">
    <div class="container editorial-columns">
      <div class="editorial-kicker">Division 01 / R&amp;D</div>
      <div class="editorial-copy">
        <h2>Research &amp; development.</h2>
        <p>The Smol Model Company of New Haven is an independent laboratory studying useful model capability under practical constraints of compute, memory, bandwidth, latency, power, data, and cost.</p>
        <p>Its work centers controlled experiments, reproducible evidence, and careful reporting of limitations. The laboratory has its own research identity and public site.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://thesmolmodel.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit the Smol Model Company <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-section alt" id="systems">
    <div class="container editorial-columns">
      <div class="editorial-kicker">Division 02 / Systems</div>
      <div class="editorial-copy">
        <h2>Technical systems &amp; practice.</h2>
        <p>Technical services and documentation for organizations that need a clearer understanding of their existing environments. The earlier Mathim consulting offerings remain available, within the broader organizational directory rather than defining the entire organization.</p>
        <div class="service-pricing">
          <div class="pricing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Service 01</span><h3>Focused audit</h3><p>A targeted review of an environment component and a written report.</p><span class="price">Starting at $300</span></div>
          <div class="pricing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Service 02</span><h3>Full environment audit</h3><p>Devices, M365, backups, network, and prioritized recommendations.</p><span class="price">Starting at $1,200</span></div>
          <div class="pricing-card"><span class="eyebrow">Service 03</span><h3>Readiness review</h3><p>Specified framework gap analysis and operational documentation.</p><span class="price">Starting at $2,500</span></div>
        </div>
        <p>Documentation, SOPs, and strategy work are scoped separately. Each engagement is evaluated individually.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact">Discuss a technical project <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-section" id="publications">
    <div class="container editorial-columns">
      <div class="editorial-kicker">Division 03 / Publishing</div>
      <div class="editorial-copy">
        <h2>Publications &amp; independent work.</h2>
        <p>Research notes, essays, reusable technical resources, and creative work without a fixed category. The work remains accessible; it no longer has to serve as the entire Mathim identity.</p>
        <div class="index-table">
          <div class="index-line"><span class="section-index">01</span><div><h3>Vesper</h3><p>Essays on technology, continuity, research, and creative practice.</p></div><a href="https://acgh213.github.io/vesper-blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read ↗</a></div>
          <div class="index-line"><span class="section-index">02</span><div><h3>Tools & documentation</h3><p>Reusable technical resources and practical reference material.</p></div><a href="https://mathim.gumroad.com/l/epwnh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>